    {
      "issue": "The fake cmux executables fail on CI's pinned Node 20.0.0. These extensionless files contain static imports but have no enclosing package declaring module type, so Node parses them as CommonJS and rejects them before the fixture runs. Parsing the generated body with module detection disabled reproduced the SyntaxError. This blocks successful opens in all five listed suites. See the [Node 20 module rules](https://nodejs.org/download/release/v20.0.0/docs/api/esm.html#enabling).",
      "file": "tests/agent-cli.mjs",
