      "issue": "These suites preserve CODEX_HOME, CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR and GROK_HOME while replacing HOME. The fake cmux honors those overrides when writing transcripts, so verification can write synthetic sessions into the user's actual harness homes. An in-memory execution confirmed writes outside the temporary home. With CODEX_HOME set, parallel suites also reuse rollout-session-1.jsonl and can overwrite one another's fixtures, causing incorrect discovery or failures.",
